msgstr "모두가 {other}를 피해 갈 때, {actor}만은 오히려 걸어갔다."

#. resolved-locale: ko
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.WRATH_SAW_CRYING_1
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.WRATH_SAW_CRYING_1"
