msgstr "{subject}는 지나가다 울음소리를 듣고, 발소리를 낮췄다."

#. resolved-locale: ko
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.WRATH_SAW_CRYING_3
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.LOG_STORY.WRATH_SAW_CRYING_3"
